 The ongoing fiscal and financial strains in Europe may have affected lending 
       conditions and funding options for banks headquartered in Europe and their affiliates 
       and subsidiaries. <b>Question 10</b>
 addresses 
       changes in your bank's lending policies toward these banking organizations over the past 
       three months. <b>Question 11</b>
 addresses changes 
       in these organizations&#8217; demand for funding from U.S. banks. <b> Question 
       12</b>
 asks about changes in business at 
       your bank as a result of increased or decreased competition from European banks 
       and their affiliates and subsidiaries.  

	<p></p>
